OL,3,GNEWSACommunity rallies round after farm
OL,4,Ashop burglary
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owners of a farm shop which was
OL,7,Ffacing closure after a burglary say
OL,8,Fthey are overwhelmed after an online
OL,9,Fappeal raised nearly #8,000 in a few
OL,10,Fdays.
OL,12,FSouth Brockwells Farm Shop near
OL,13,FUckfield, East Sussex, lost all its
OL,14,FChristmas stock and butchering
OL,15,Fequipment in the robbery on Friday.
OL,17,FOwner Chrissy Wells described the
OL,18,F"terrifying" moment she and her husband
OL,19,FAaron caught the gang in the act.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
